Package: svdx
Type: Package
Title: Smoothing Spline ANOVA-Singular Value Decomposition
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person(
    given = "M. Senthil",
    family = "Kumar",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "senthil@ds.dfci.harvard.edu"
    )
Description: Implements Smoothing Spline Analysis of Variance-Singular Value
    Decomposition (SSANOVA-SVD) for system-level modeling of high-dimensional
    data. The method reconstructs overarching processes as smooth functions
    of observed covariates and estimates feature loadings describing their
    contributions to the measurements. The fitted models support prediction
    of processes in new observations and subsequent conditional inference
    of feature participation.
